 * A cursor over the source text's Unicode code points, tracking the
 * 1-based line and column of the next character to be read.
 *
 * Tabs advance the column to the next multiple of 4 plus 1; line feeds
 * move to the next line and reset the column to 1; every other code
 * point advances the column by 1.
